# Thai date picker

New and edited date fields in this web app use `ThaiDatePicker` from `@/components/ui/thai-date-picker`. Do not add `type="date"`.

The control shows a Buddhist-era date such as `10 ตุลาคม 2569`. The value sent to the server stays `YYYY-MM-DD`.

- Controlled field: pass `value` and `onChange`.
- FormData field: pass `name`. Add `required`, `min`, or `max` when the field needs them. `min` and `max` are ISO dates.
- Display a stored date with `formatThaiDateFromIso`.

```tsx
<ThaiDatePicker
  name="received_at"
  label="วันที่รับ"
  required
  defaultValue={today}
  max={today}
/>
```
